[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
shit needs a privileged helper for pre-mutation capture. Start the daemon
at boot with, in /etc/rc.conf:

  shit_enable="YES"
  shit_user="<your login>"

or run it by hand with `shit service start`. Add the shell hook with
`shit hooks install`, then check the install with `shit doctor`.

The preload shim is installed at %%PREFIX%%/lib/shit/libshit_preload_shim.so.
EOM
}
]
